# Prestium: web links from Gajim open in Tor Browser (app-confine "env links-tor" puts this folder first in
# XDG_CONFIG_DIRS). GIO opens links itself, outside Flatpak it does not use the OpenURI portal, and the
# image's only other web handler is the I2P Browser (librewolf.desktop), which Gajim's AppArmor profile
# may not start; Gajim's profile allows /usr/local/bin/tor-browser (Px into the launcher's profile).
[Default Applications]
x-scheme-handler/http=torbrowser.desktop
x-scheme-handler/https=torbrowser.desktop
